# Battle.net. Environment and helper from frankea/Whisky's LauncherPresets.swift
# (GPL-3.0-or-later). The download link has no file name, the app names it after the response.
# Chromium's NVIDIA probe would load D3DMetal's nvapi into the DXVK processes: off there.
# Tested 10/10/2026: installs (the setup waits for its Continue button) and starts, but the
# login page's renderer (32-bit Battle.net.exe --type=renderer, Chromium 108) breaks at the same
# int3 every time, with or without hardware acceleration; planned until that is solved.
name Battle.net
kind launcher
status planned
symbol b.circle
about Лаунчер Blizzard. Ставится и запускается, но страница входа не грузится: его встроенный браузер падает (10/10/2026). Пока выключен.
about-en Blizzard's launcher. It installs and starts, but the sign-in page does not load: its built-in browser crashes (10/10/2026). Off for now.
bottle battlenet
installer https://downloader.battle.net/download/getInstallerForGame?os=win&gameProgram=BATTLENET_APP&version=Live --lang=enUS
exe C:\Program Files (x86)\Battle.net\Battle.net Launcher.exe
env LC_ALL=en_US.UTF-8
env CEF_DISABLE_SANDBOX=1
dxvk Battle.net Launcher.exe
dxvk Battle.net.exe
dxvk Battle.net Helper.exe
dll Battle.net Launcher.exe nvapi64=,nvapi=,nvngx=
dll Battle.net.exe nvapi64=,nvapi=,nvngx=
dll Battle.net Helper.exe nvapi64=,nvapi=,nvngx=
